{
  "bank": "act_math",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-26T18:24:35+00:00",
  "method": "calibrated = median of all independent AI ratings for the item (the per-batch blind solver, the 2026-10-26 rubric rater on the first 48, and the 2026-10-26b whole-bank single-sitting rater); with an even number of ratings the lower (easier) middle value is used. The author label is never used. Accepted records are unchanged.",
